Senate proposal of amendment
H. 582
An act relating to adult protective services.
The Senate proposes to the House to amend the bill in Sec. 1, 33 V.S.A.
§ 6902, in subdivision (36)(B), following “power of attorney”, by striking out
“or an advance directive”

